                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a6afd88f-cd91-39d2-a949-806dec6d640b",
                        "entry_id": "0dce5e5f-44e3-3564-af12-29a1e899a293",
                        "glosses": [
                            "сосуд, предохраняющий помещённый в него продукт от остывания или нагревания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15c29c81-9ce0-491e-8b58-4ea076622bf7",
                                "sense_id": "a6afd88f-cd91-39d2-a949-806dec6d640b",
                                "text": "Когда они повесили свой чайник на огонь, он достал термосы, зарыл их наполовину в снег и через пять минут стал наливать горячий чай изумленным якутам."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "722fa06a-0a2f-41c2-b362-41fb88263908",
                                "sense_id": "a6afd88f-cd91-39d2-a949-806dec6d640b",
                                "text": "Отвинтив стаканчик термоса, я сел под сосной на мягкую моховую кочку, налил чаю, стал потихоньку пить, мало-помалу забылся и слился с природой."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "adf703de-cc6b-474b-b202-ee86cad4c0b3",
                        "source_entry_id": "0dce5e5f-44e3-3564-af12-29a1e899a293",
                        "source_sense_id": "a6afd88f-cd91-39d2-a949-806dec6d640b",
                        "target_lang_word": "thermos",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thermos",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f33eb1c6-188d-34f0-b8d7-0d95bbbd2cf4",
                                        "entry_id": "885271d0-ffa7-3b26-b1b3-8d4da5f0ce16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bottle, flask or similar vessel having a vacuum between its inner and outer silvered walls; designed to maintain the temperature of its contents"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "thermos",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a271061-2c34-3c2e-8b29-92e07174a5d0",
                                        "entry_id": "1a01f602-6cc5-346a-bd7c-5ba1e079f205",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unit of measure whose identification remains very unclear."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bec46a08-a430-4d50-9e4b-bcc135580250",
                                                "sense_id": "9a271061-2c34-3c2e-8b29-92e07174a5d0",
                                                "text": "The mnaeion contains 4 gold pieces, 16 quarters, 64 thermoi, 128 carats. The gold piece contains 4 staters [sic for quarters], 16 thermoi, 32 carats. The thermos contains 2 carats. The quarter contains 4 thermoi, 8 carats. The thermos contains 2 carats.[…]The mnaeion has sixteen (16) quarters and the quarter has 6 thermoi, twelve (12) carats. The thermos has 2 carats, so that the mnaeion consists of 96 thermoi, 192 carats. The mnaeion weighs 8 drachmas, the quarter three obols, the thermos one-half obol, the carat 2 chalci.[…]Thermoi of 2 and of 1½ siliquae are attested in metrological writings (MSR II 180, s.v. θέρμοϲ); ½ ob. per thermus^([sic]) in 18 implies the lighter weight, as 1 ob. = 3 sil.[…]The mnaeion has 16 quarters and the quarter has (4 or 6) thermoi…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9eb4fc1d-8169-43c7-a196-15dc0a6fa1e8",
                                                "sense_id": "9a271061-2c34-3c2e-8b29-92e07174a5d0",
                                                "text": "1 saton (seʾah) = 1/3 ephah (see above for correction) = 2/3 bath / mina by weight = 50 shekels / ¼ shekel = 4 thermoi / shekel = 16 thermoi and one weight (?)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d55aeb98-3003-4d63-8ab6-729fb86ec8c9",
                                                "sense_id": "9a271061-2c34-3c2e-8b29-92e07174a5d0",
                                                "text": "A third of a seah is a third of an ephah, and two-thirds of a bath, and the weight of a mina is fifty of shekels, and a quarter of a shekel is the weight of four thermoi.ᵍ Let the shekel be about sixteen thermoi and of one weight.[…]g. “thermoi”—A unit of measure whose identification remains very unclear."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
